# Auto-regenerated working state (machine-local; rewritten on each auto-compaction)
.agent/state/handoff.md

# Machine-readable run state: written AFTER the commit it points to (head_sha =
# that commit), so it can never be tracked+committed+current at once — gitignored
# by design. The human-readable proof (_reports/runs/*.md) stays tracked.
_reports/runs/latest.json

# Context Guard v4: task handoffs, telemetry, compact-log (machine-local, ephemeral)
.claude/handoffs/

# --- BLC project-owned additions ---
# LibreOffice/Excel lock files next to the client .xlsx/.docx
.~lock.*#
